{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/1b85e83c300722ef342bc21b1a34ff8b.avif?t=1771099161\" width=748 height=293 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fly</strong>\u00a0around and\u00a0<strong>explore</strong> the island at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather</strong> seeds to <strong>replant</strong> the forests.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/5be6974540d037a10bc629cad46486fa.poster.avif?t=1771099161\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/5be6974540d037a10bc629cad46486fa.webm?t=1771099161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/5be6974540d037a10bc629cad46486fa.mp4?t=1771099161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chat</strong> and <strong>make friends</strong> with the locals - they might help you with clues and directions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There used to be ton of <strong>native flowers</strong> on the island. Are they all gone or just really well hidden?<br>  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/e1930a768f824dd37bf8bb8b28f66947.poster.avif?t=1771099161\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/e1930a768f824dd37bf8bb8b28f66947.webm?t=1771099161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/e1930a768f824dd37bf8bb8b28f66947.mp4?t=1771099161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hike</strong> up the hills and mountains to take in the view, and <strong>level up</strong>! Can you reach all the peaks?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t forget to <strong>catch</strong> some worms for dinner while you\u2019re out and about!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/e7653b42398e8a6df441d5909642f3eb.poster.avif?t=1771099161\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/e7653b42398e8a6df441d5909642f3eb.webm?t=1771099161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/extras/e7653b42398e8a6df441d5909642f3eb.mp4?t=1771099161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3575210?t=1771099161","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/9c45cf0782bed13ca7c9e7b6033e804a0bf53f5a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771099161","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/9c570bf423108e4f75003aa660e31c9ecdeb7910/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771099161","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3575210/9c570bf423108e4f75003aa660e31c9ecdeb7910/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771099161","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragra